  "body": "I think you want to create a normal ArrayBuffer, then freeze it (by applying [SetIntegrityLevel](https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-setintegritylevel)(O, \"frozen\")). Note that this makes it immutable, not just read-only; I couldn't tell whether you were modifying the values from the spec or not.\n",
